# Workflow

1. Analyze code and Git state before editing.
2. Prefer one dedicated branch and one PR; never merge unless a human asks.
3. Smallest complete change; reuse architecture.
4. Implement → targeted tests → full `npm test` / `lint` / `build` → fix own failures.
5. Update `docs/ROADMAP.md` and `docs/CHANGELOG.md` for the next agent.
6. Stop for destructive data, storage-key, sync-conflict, or major architecture decisions.
7. Details: `AGENTS.md`, `.cursor/rules/preventivai-agent-workflow.mdc`, `docs/CLOUD-AGENT-OVERNIGHT.md`.
